{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2021-07-08 10:00:00', 'title': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP LAUNCHES SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT', 'text': "NEW YORK, JULY 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCANN WORLDGROUP HAS LAUNCHED A SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT TO COMMIT RESOURCES TO, AND DRIVE FORWARD, THE NETWORK'S SUSTAINABILITY AGENDA. THE AGENCY ANNOUNCED THAT JACLYN KAMINSKI, A DIRECTOR OF BUSINESS LEADERSHIP AT MCCANN LONDON, HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF GLOBAL DIRECTOR OF SUSTAINABILITY, AND WILL LEAD THE DEPARTMENT."}{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2021-07-08 10:00:00', 'title': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP LAUNCHES SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT', 'text': "NEW YORK, JULY 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCANN WORLDGROUP HAS LAUNCHED A SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT TO COMMIT RESOURCES TO, AND DRIVE FORWARD, THE NETWORK'S SUSTAINABILITY AGENDA. THE AGENCY ANNOUNCED THAT JACLYN KAMINSKI, A DIRECTOR OF BUSINESS LEADERSHIP AT MCCANN LONDON, HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF GLOBAL DIRECTOR OF SUSTAINABILITY, AND WILL LEAD THE DEPARTMENT."}{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2021-07-08 10:00:00', 'title': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP LAUNCHES SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT', 'text': "NEW YORK, JULY 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCANN WORLDGROUP HAS LAUNCHED A SUSTAINABILITY DEPARTMENT TO COMMIT RESOURCES TO, AND DRIVE FORWARD, THE NETWORK'S SUSTAINABILITY AGENDA. THE AGENCY ANNOUNCED THAT JACLYN KAMINSKI, A DIRECTOR OF BUSINESS LEADERSHIP AT MCCANN LONDON, HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF GLOBAL DIRECTOR OF SUSTAINABILITY, AND WILL LEAD THE DEPARTMENT."}